{"id":3131,"date":"2021-01-27T14:58:58","date_gmt":"2021-01-27T14:58:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/application-support\/validation-of-spectrometers\/"},"modified":"2021-05-20T10:28:41","modified_gmt":"2021-05-20T10:28:41","slug":"validation-of-spectrometers","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/application-support\/validation-of-spectrometers\/","title":{"rendered":"Validation of spectrometers"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3131\" class=\"elementor elementor-3131 elementor-381\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-68caa53 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"68caa53\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1e74fad\" data-id=\"1e74fad\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7379480 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7379480\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our company provides testing, calibration, validation (so-called spectral tests) and service of spectrometers of all offered types. We will always meet your needs, the rules of your workplace and the required legislation. In case of any questions or ambiguities, please <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contact us<\/a>.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5bc7e06 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5bc7e06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"249\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1024x319.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-393\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1024x319.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-300x93.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-768x239.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101-1536x478.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/c0865101.jpg 1700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfe3527 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bfe3527\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>What is calibration? &#8220;Calibration is a set of operations in which the value of a calibrated device is determined and compared with the corresponding known value of the standard&#8221;. Qualification is then the stage of the validation process and is an individual part of the process. The exact qualification and calibration requirements depend on the application.<\/p>\n<p><strong>The qualification has four parts (The 4 Q\u2019s):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design Qualification (DQ)<\/li>\n<li>Installation Qualification (IQ)<\/li>\n<li>Operational Qualification (OQ)<\/li>\n<li>Performance Qualification (PQ)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34c6959 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" dat